{'symbol': 'ALK', 'date': '2021-10-05 08:00:00', 'title': 'ALASKA AIRLINES LAUNCHES NEW CODESHARE AGREEMENT WITH IBERIA AIRLINES', 'text': 'SEATTLE, OCT. 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ALASKA AIRLINES FURTHER EXPANDED ITS GLOBAL REACH TODAY WITH THE ANNOUNCEMENT OF A NEW CODESHARE AGREEMENT WITH IBERIA AIRLINES, A FELLOW MEMBER OF THE ONEWORLD ALLIANCE . THE AGREEMENT FURTHER STRENGTHENS THE EXISTING PARTNERSHIP BETWEEN THE TWO AIRLINES BY PROVIDING FLYERS WITH EXCITING AND CONVENIENT TRAVEL OPTIONS.'}